{"id":"reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1","date":"2026-10-21","topic":"code","region":"americas","headline":"NASA Fixes Voyager 1 Computer From Earth","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voyager_1"},"accent":"us","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"NASA sent Voyager One into space in 1977.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.42,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":5.69,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.84,1.12,1.7,2.0,2.38,2.78]},{"text":"It sent bad messages back in November 2023.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.42,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":5.31,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.24,0.54,1.02,1.44,1.74,2.06]},{"text":"Workers on Earth found a broken computer part.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":2.9,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.34,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.5,0.78,1.18,1.46,1.76,2.34]},{"text":"They moved the computer program to another part.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":2.62,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":3.86,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.36,0.62,0.92,1.38,1.74,2.02]},{"text":"The machine sent good information again in April 2024.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.16,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":5.56,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,0.66,0.94,1.22,1.82,2.18,2.6]}],"bands":{"core1000":97,"core1800":0,"ngsl":0,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"sent","title":"Past Simple Tense","note":"We use the past simple tense to talk about actions completed in the past. Here, 'sent' shows an action that happened in 1977."},{"i":1,"focus":"bad messages","title":"Direct Object","note":"A direct object receives the action of the verb. In this sentence, 'bad messages' tells us what the spacecraft sent."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"NASA sent the Voyager One machine far into space in 1977.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.4,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":7.36,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.84,1.04,1.4,1.9,2.3,2.8,3.22,3.62,4.02]},{"text":"It worked well, but it began sending confusing data in November 2023.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":5.46,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":7.84,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,1.04,1.3,1.5,1.78,2.28,2.62,3.46,3.88,4.08]},{"text":"Workers found a broken memory part, which holds computer data.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","S","V","O","O"],"dur":3.82,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":7.8,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.56,0.88,1.2,1.62,2.4,2.46,2.72,3.18]},{"text":"They could not replace the part, so they moved the code instructions.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","V","O","O","M","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":4.0,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":5.67,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.24,0.42,0.8,1.1,1.66,1.88,2.14,2.48,2.76,3.0]},{"text":"The team sent this clever software fix from Earth to space.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.04,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":5.09,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,0.64,0.92,1.3,1.76,2.26,2.64,2.94,3.4]},{"text":"The machine sent clear data again in April 2024 and will continue working.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","V","V","O"],"dur":5.81,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":6.81,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,0.68,1.04,1.38,1.8,2.2,2.62,3.26,4.1,4.24,4.66]}],"bands":{"core1000":89,"core1800":5,"ngsl":2,"tsl":0,"nawl":2,"beyond":2},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"began sending","title":"Gerund as Object","note":"Verbs like 'begin' can take a gerund (-ing form) as their direct object. Here, 'sending' functions as the noun object of 'began'."},{"i":2,"focus":"which holds computer data","title":"Relative Clause","note":"A relative clause starts with a relative pronoun like 'which' to give extra details about a noun. Here, it describes what the 'memory part' does."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"NASA launched the Voyager 1 space vehicle in 1977 to explore distant planets.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t3-0.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.84,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":8.6,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.88,1.16,1.56,1.98,2.28,2.86,3.2,4.24,4.92,5.3,5.8]},{"text":"The robotic vehicle has traveled for decades, but it began sending garbled data in November 2023.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":6.94,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":9.42,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.34,0.88,1.22,1.6,1.92,3.12,3.2,3.3,3.54,4.02,4.58,4.96,5.32,5.52]},{"text":"Engineers examined the vehicle and found a broken memory chip, which stores system information.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","V","O","O","O","O","S","V","O","O"],"dur":5.79,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":7.29,"times":[0.0,0.42,0.88,1.32,1.58,2.02,2.32,2.48,2.82,3.18,4.0,4.18,4.44,4.84]},{"text":"Because they could not replace the physical equipment, the team created a smart software update.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t3-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","V","V","O","O","O","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.55,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":7.4,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.44,0.58,0.76,1.18,1.52,1.78,2.74,2.9,3.14,3.62,3.84,4.16,4.8]},{"text":"They moved the broken code, or computer instructions, to other healthy memory sections.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.43,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":7.5,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.38,0.66,0.94,1.88,1.94,2.34,3.34,3.54,3.74,4.16,4.52]},{"text":"The team sent these new repair instructions across 24 billion kilometers of space.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.65,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":7.37,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.32,0.66,0.92,1.22,1.56,2.14,2.72,3.3,4.08,4.54,5.04]},{"text":"In April 2024, Voyager 1 successfully returned clear scientific data to delighted engineers on Earth.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t3-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","M","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.77,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":10.14,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.44,1.64,2.04,2.44,3.0,3.7,4.2,4.76,5.34,5.7,6.08,6.6,6.98]}],"bands":{"core1000":66,"core1800":19,"ngsl":9,"tsl":1,"nawl":0,"beyond":5},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"to explore distant planets","title":"Infinitive of Purpose","note":"An infinitive phrase (to + verb) can express purpose or goal. Here, it explains why NASA launched the vehicle."},{"i":1,"focus":"has traveled","title":"Present Perfect Tense","note":"The present perfect connects a past action to the present. 'Has traveled' shows an ongoing journey that started in 1977 and continues into the present."},{"i":3,"focus":"Because they could not replace","title":"Adverbial Clause of Reason","note":"The conjunction 'because' introduces an adverbial clause that gives the reason for the main action, explaining why the team created a software update."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"The famous Voyager 1 space probe was launched by NASA in September 1977 to explore deep space.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t4-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.71,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":10.17,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.62,1.12,1.6,1.94,2.32,2.64,2.94,3.26,3.52,3.96,4.3,5.42,6.14,6.5,6.92]},{"text":"After traveling farther than any human object, the craft began transmitting unreadable data streams in November 2023.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t4-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":8.05,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":11.27,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.64,1.0,1.46,1.78,2.26,3.3,3.36,3.58,4.02,4.66,5.4,5.76,6.16,6.54,6.72]},{"text":"Diagnostic checks revealed that a single memory chip, an electronic component storing data, had failed completely.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t4-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","V","M"],"dur":7.06,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":8.1,"times":[0.0,0.6,0.82,1.24,1.72,1.8,2.2,2.5,3.32,3.5,3.78,4.34,4.78,5.62,5.76,6.08]},{"text":"Because physical repairs were impossible across vast distance, engineers were forced to devise an alternative software solution.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t4-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","C","M","M","M","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.87,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":10.02,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.56,1.08,1.52,2.04,2.66,3.0,4.0,4.48,4.88,5.16,5.52,5.76,6.12,6.32,7.0]},{"text":"They carefully divided the affected code, or program instructions, and moved it to working memory locations.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t4-4.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.26,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":9.09,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.4,0.94,1.28,1.6,2.46,2.54,2.88,3.86,4.06,4.3,4.48,4.64,4.94,5.26]},{"text":"A complex update command was transmitted across 24 billion kilometers of deep space to reach the craft.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.4,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":7.62,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.48,0.86,1.26,1.54,2.06,2.54,3.08,3.82,4.28,4.72,4.88,5.2,5.52,5.68,5.88]},{"text":"Engineers reported that the remote code fix had reached the craft and restored its operational functions.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t4-6.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","S","S","S","S","V","V","O","O","M","V","O","O","O"],"dur":5.49,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":7.25,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.76,1.04,1.14,1.44,1.74,2.04,2.36,2.62,2.86,3.1,3.38,3.74,4.14,4.6]},{"text":"In April 2024, Voyager 1 finally resumed sending valuable scientific information back to Earth control.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t4-7.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.35,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":8.52,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.42,1.66,2.08,2.44,2.98,3.36,3.92,4.36,4.98,5.5,6.04,6.22,6.36]}],"bands":{"core1000":63,"core1800":19,"ngsl":9,"tsl":5,"nawl":1,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"was launched","title":"Passive Voice","note":"The passive voice highlights the object being acted upon rather than the agent. Here, 'was launched' emphasizes the spacecraft rather than NASA."},{"i":2,"focus":"had failed","title":"Past Perfect Tense","note":"The past perfect tense indicates an event that happened before another point in the past. The chip 'had failed' before diagnostic checks revealed it."},{"i":6,"focus":"that the remote code fix had reached","title":"Noun Clause Object","note":"A subordinate clause starting with 'that' can function as the direct object of a reporting verb like 'reported'."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Launched by NASA in September 1977, Voyager 1 has long served as humanity's most distant robotic explorer in interstellar space.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":10.29,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":12.74,"times":[0.0,0.46,0.66,0.92,1.42,1.76,3.74,4.0,4.64,4.94,5.2,5.68,5.94,6.66,6.82,7.24,7.86,8.48,8.94,9.26]},{"text":"The historic mission faced a critical challenge in November 2023 when the aging spacecraft began sending an unreadable stream of total nonsense.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t5-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":9.82,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":12.25,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.42,0.76,1.16,1.42,1.7,2.4,2.66,2.84,4.02,4.68,4.8,5.02,5.64,6.12,6.62,6.88,7.52,7.98,8.36,8.76]},{"text":"Engineers on Earth eventually traced the system failure to a single corrupted memory chip inside the onboard computer architecture.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t5-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","M","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.52,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":11.23,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.6,0.84,1.48,1.86,2.14,2.44,2.72,3.12,3.26,3.6,4.2,4.56,5.02,5.46,5.76,5.98,6.56]},{"text":"Since physical hardware replacement was out of the question across 24 billion kilometers, technicians had to engineer a creative software workaround.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","V","C","C","C","C","M","M","M","M","S","V","V","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":9.39,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":11.81,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.54,0.92,1.46,1.82,2.1,2.22,2.32,2.74,3.24,3.74,4.58,5.8,6.08,6.54,6.66,7.02,7.32,7.72,8.4]},{"text":"They meticulously restructured the affected computer code, breaking it into smaller fragments to fit inside remaining healthy memory cells.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t5-4.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.06,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":10.39,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.64,1.76,1.94,2.2,2.62,3.42,3.74,4.0,4.1,4.5,5.08,5.5,5.68,5.98,6.28,6.94,7.34]},{"text":"These intricate repair commands were beamed across the cosmic expanse, requiring almost a full day to reach the distant probe.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t5-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.51,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":8.81,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.64,0.92,1.38,1.82,2.16,2.6,2.9,3.22,4.26,4.5,5.06,5.28,5.56,5.96,6.22,6.42,6.66,6.92]},{"text":"Mission controllers waited anxiously while the light-speed signals made their long round trip across the vast solar system.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t5-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.58,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":8.41,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.6,1.0,1.78,2.14,2.29,2.74,3.14,3.46,3.62,3.92,4.26,4.64,5.04,5.26,5.56,5.96]},{"text":"Their patience and technical ingenuity paid off in April 2024, when Voyager 1 finally resumed sending readable scientific data.","voice":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/t5-7.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","S","S","M","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.65,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-code-nasa-fixes-voyager-1/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":10.78,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.48,0.78,1.18,1.56,2.12,2.44,2.66,3.04,4.38,4.6,4.82,5.3,5.84,6.12,6.7,7.0,7.6]}],"bands":{"core1000":61,"core1800":12,"ngsl":9,"tsl":5,"nawl":1,"beyond":12},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"Launched by NASA in September 1977,","title":"Participial Modifier","note":"A past participle phrase at the sentence start acts as an adjectival modifier for the subject 'Voyager 1', giving concise background information."},{"i":4,"focus":"breaking it into smaller fragments","title":"Present Participle Clause","note":"An -ing participial clause attached to a main clause describes an accompanying action or result, showing how the restructuring was executed."},{"i":6,"focus":"while the light-speed signals made","title":"Adverbial Clause of Time","note":"The subordinating conjunction 'while' introduces a time clause indicating that two events were occurring simultaneously."}]}},"glossary":[{"word":"memory chip","lemma":"memory chip","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈmɛməri tʃɪp/","definition":"a small electronic part used to store digital data","tiers":["t3","t4","t5"]},{"word":"unreadable","lemma":"unreadable","pos":"adjective","ipa":"/ʌnˈridəbəl/","definition":"impossible to read or understand clearly","tiers":["t4","t5"]},{"word":"hardware","lemma":"hardware","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈhɑrdˌwɛr/","definition":"the physical parts of a computer system","tiers":["t5"]},{"word":"transmitted","lemma":"transmit","pos":"verb","ipa":"/trænˈsmɪtɪd/","definition":"sent signals or information from one place to another","tiers":["t4"]},{"word":"workaround","lemma":"workaround","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈwɜrkəˌraʊnd/","definition":"a creative method used to solve a technical